# Third-Party Licenses

To generate the complete listing:
  cargo install cargo-about && cargo about generate > THIRD_PARTY_LICENSES_RUST.md
  npx license-checker --production --csv > THIRD_PARTY_LICENSES_NPM.csv

All Rust deps: Apache-2.0 or MIT (verified via cargo-deny).
All npm deps: MIT, Apache-2.0, BSD-2-Clause, BSD-3-Clause, or ISC.
No GPL/AGPL dependencies included.

Run: cargo deny check licenses
